<title>POLAND: BetonStal turns to profit at PLN 0.1 mln.</title>
<headline>BetonStal turns to profit at PLN 0.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BatonStal preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.25 vs	0.23 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.16 vs	0.14 loss</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.10 vs	0.14</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: BetonStal SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				  8.37 vs	1.90</p>
<p>    costs of sales			   8.09 vs	1.60</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.05 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.18 vs	0.47</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.27 vs	0.38</p>
<p>    investment				 1.45 vs	0.28</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
